  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a small bowl, mix together yeast, sugar, and warm milk. Let it sit for 5 minutes until frothy.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together flour, baking powder, salt, and cinnamon.",
    "Add the softened butter and mix until it resembles coarse crumbs.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together eggs and the yeast mixture. Add the wet ingredients to the dry ingredients and mix until a smooth batter forms.",
    "Gently fold in the chopped yam until well combined.",
    "Pour the batter into a greased 9x13-inch baking dish.",
    "Bake for 35-40 minutes or until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean."
